      "date": "2026-10-23",
      "status": "available",
      "source": {
        "repository": "https://github.com/DreamWeave-MP/DreamWeave-Mod-Template",
        "tag": "template-0.4.0",
        "revision": "dd60cd17c7b28abb8c912909db10c519224bad9d"
      },
      "notes": {
        "summary": "Every protocol document is written at schema_version 4, and a Jess package can release an application: a packed workspace and an executable per platform, which jess install installs.",
        "added": [
          "`[package] application` in mod.toml releases a jpk project as an application too: CI packs it into dist/application with the jess image, named by StroggForge's jess_application input, and the release records the .jsw as a jsw artifact with its jess_workspace block and each platform's executable as a zipped binary artifact."
        ],
        "breaking": [
          "Sites are written at protocol schema_version 4, which jess reads from 0.2.0 on: an older jess can't sync packages from a site built with this release."
        ]
      },
